## Strategy Request Quality Checklist
Before finalising any Strategy Request, verify:
1. Tables paste cleanly to Word/CRM (no bullets/special characters)
2. Summary is action-only (assumptions in Projection Parameters)
3. Alternatives are adviser-considered and dismissed (not new strategies)
4. Product Considerations are platform/product comparisons (not strategies)
5. Notes list gap items to request from client
6. Key numbers appear twice where helpful (annual and monthly)
7. Carry-forward verified via ATO portal (not estimated)
8. Source-of-Truth documented for all key inputs
9. Risk profile mismatch disclosed if applicable
10. Insurance continuity flagged for any super rollovers
